      "Robots are no longer the stuff of science fiction; increasingly, they are moving into our factories and our homes. In the foreseeable future, when more and more machines take over tasks once done by people, both industrial production and everyday life will be reshaped. To my mind, this shift will prove a double-edged sword.",
